<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CEZ says signs $317 mln synd loan.</title>
<headline>Czech CEZ says signs $317 mln synd loan.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech power utility CEZ a.s. said on Tuesday it had signed a $317 million syndicated loan led by Citibank London and Generale Bank Brusel to finance the completion of the Temelin nuclear power plant.</p>
</text>
